WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.717
When does the next cohort start?

2
00:00:03.117 --> 00:00:04.887
Here's how it works.

3
00:00:05.087 --> 00:00:08.226
Every cohort is small, limited to
twelve members.

4
00:00:08.226 --> 00:00:10.616
So the first step is your
application.

5
00:00:10.616 --> 00:00:14.726
Once it's reviewed and approved,
we share the start date with you.

6
00:00:14.726 --> 00:00:16.519
That keeps each group small,

7
00:00:16.519 --> 00:00:19.134
focused and ready to do the work
together.

8
00:00:19.134 --> 00:00:22.272
If you're curious, start your
application today.

9
00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:25.933
And if you'd rather talk first,
book a short conversation.

10
00:00:26.133 --> 00:00:27.231
No pitch.

11
00:00:27.631 --> 00:00:28.953
No pressure.
